AUDIT_FAIL: **Bash 3.2 incompatibility** — Use of `${var,,}` on lines 139, 178, 220, 378. Remove the `,,` suffix since variables are already lowercase strings. This violates CLAUDE.md requirements and will be flagged by sw-patrol-meta.sh.
